     "value": 8,
     "intent": "Deficiency: in the adopted 12-candidate roster, the six signed_rank_sum crossovers average about 0.0617 absolute IC, versus about 0.0421 for the six residual_size mutations; the amihud_20 and volume_ratio_5_20 residuals are the weakest at 0.031403 and 0.029718. Semantics: crossover slots are reserved before mutations and raw-seed padding within the fixed budget of 12. Mechanism: raising the reservation from 6 to 8 should produce eight crossovers and four round-robin residual_size mutations, replacing the two weakest residual candidates if the existing seed order is retained. Expect n_candidates=12 and pass_count=12; mean_abs_ic exceeds the adopted 0.0528727 if the two added crossovers contribute more combined absolute IC than the 0.0611215 removed with those two residuals, while roster_effect must be changed. Monitor novelty and duplicate_rate because the prior expansion reduced novelty from 0.375 to 0.1. Uncertainty: the additional pairs may involve weaker seeds or highly correlated parents, and six observed crossovers do not establish that every added pair will be stronger; failure to obtain the expected 8-crossover/4-mutation composition falsifies the reallocation premise, and failure to raise common-support mean_abs_ic falsifies the intended benefit."
    }
